      "sourceTextSha256": "a59ae5e187d47d5cdcb361da579a1faeaa23b68221f83795a244f0ce2663a25f",
      "text": "After breakfast, meet at the hotel at 08:00 for the transfer to the Honduran border and then on to the colonial town of Copán.\n\nOn arrival, check in at your hotel overlooking the central square. At 14:30, your guided tour of the main archaeological site begins. You will visit the Acropolis, the ball court, the Hieroglyphic Stairway, the Great Plaza with its stelae and the Maya Sculpture Museum, which experts consider unique in the Maya world.\n\nThe museum’s centrepiece is an exact replica of the famous Rosalila Temple, discovered in 1989.\n\nSpend the rest of the day at the hotel or take a walk around Copán and stop by its shops, restaurants and cafés.\n\nOvernight in Copán at Hotel Marina Copan.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-mw6krd1q-6gkvrjmldy",
        "model": "GPT-6"
      }
    },
